WEBVTT

00:03.650 --> 00:06.150
Whew, I'm stuffed.

00:06.440 --> 00:08.610
We ordered so much that 
we couldn't finish it all.

00:12.780 --> 00:14.330
The night of Christmas Eve,

00:14.700 --> 00:17.590
Umi and I started dating.

00:19.100 --> 00:22.500
Maki, your belly flab's alive and well.

00:22.500 --> 00:24.500
You're one to talk...

00:25.150 --> 00:27.090
or so I thought.

00:27.340 --> 00:30.400
I don't see anywhere I can pinch, 
so you've got me there.

00:30.760 --> 00:34.060
I put in the effort behind closed doors.

00:34.410 --> 00:39.020
That said, I have gained 
some weight lately.

00:39.400 --> 00:42.430
Try touching me around here 
and you'll see. Or feel.

00:42.430 --> 00:43.420
You sure?

00:43.420 --> 00:45.480
Sure. Only you get to do this.

00:45.480 --> 00:49.700
Why is that? Because I'm your boyfriend?

00:51.200 --> 00:53.280
You got that right.

00:53.280 --> 00:55.240
Well, excuse your boyfriend.

00:58.850 --> 01:01.450
Yeah, I don't know.

01:03.180 --> 01:06.300
You really need to study up more!

01:06.300 --> 01:08.090
Gaining weight and flab

01:08.090 --> 01:11.090
is a massive headache 
for girls everywhere.

01:11.780 --> 01:17.960
FYI, "I like a little meat on her bones" 
isn't very comforting either.

01:17.960 --> 01:19.810
Remember that. 
It'll come up in your exams.

01:21.230 --> 01:23.180
What exams exactly?

01:26.240 --> 01:27.490
Hey, Maki?

01:28.190 --> 01:30.810
It's about time for me to head out.

01:30.810 --> 01:31.810
Yeah.

01:32.670 --> 01:34.450
I don't wanna go!

01:34.450 --> 01:37.410
I'd like to spend more time with you, too.

01:37.410 --> 01:40.340
But we did promise our moms.

01:42.010 --> 01:43.330
Pick me up.

01:45.040 --> 01:48.640
What's with the mental age regression?

01:53.330 --> 01:54.140
Urk.

01:55.240 --> 01:57.680
Maki, I'll be good from here, thanks.

01:57.680 --> 01:59.550
What? But...

02:00.420 --> 02:03.140
I'm in the mood to walk home by myself.

02:03.140 --> 02:09.790
Just for tonight, 
I want to bask in the afterglow.

02:09.790 --> 02:10.610
I mean,

02:10.610 --> 02:14.580
the feeling of getting to be 
a couple with the boy I like.

02:14.580 --> 02:15.610
I see.

02:15.980 --> 02:17.640
Okay, see you tomorrow.

02:17.640 --> 02:20.950
Take a bath and stay warm in bed.

02:25.550 --> 02:26.670
Brr.

02:27.020 --> 02:30.410
Guess I'll take a bath and 
turn in for the night.

04:09.790 --> 04:10.940
Yikes.

04:18.360 --> 04:22.660
Honestly, I'm amazed 
I lasted as long as I did.

04:22.990 --> 04:26.160
For the past month, 
I've had so much on my mind.

04:26.590 --> 04:31.540
I guess I finally let go 
after things worked out.

04:32.750 --> 04:35.710
BACK AT WORK FROM TODAY - MOM

04:33.150 --> 04:35.710
Mom's back at work, too.

04:36.260 --> 04:40.130
I guess I should just try to deal 
with this for a couple of days.

04:40.550 --> 04:42.850
I'll text Umi and let her know.

04:44.560 --> 04:46.070
Morning, Maki!

04:46.070 --> 04:49.020
Oh, dear. I can see you're 
not having a good time.

04:49.280 --> 04:51.260
You must be running quite the fever.

04:51.260 --> 04:54.480
Umi... and Sora-san, too?

04:54.480 --> 04:56.200
Morning, Maki-kun.

04:56.200 --> 04:59.110
I thought I could accompany 
my daughter and be a busybody.

04:59.670 --> 05:04.990
You need to go see a doctor right away. 
Mom says she'll drive you.

05:05.460 --> 05:08.950
But first, why do you have 
a key to my place?

05:09.270 --> 05:12.670
Mom got it when she went drinking 
with your mom last night.

05:12.970 --> 05:13.860
Right?

05:13.860 --> 05:18.110
She made one for Umi because she figured 
you two'd be spending more time together.

05:18.110 --> 05:20.170
I wasn't sure whether 
to accept it at first,

05:20.620 --> 05:23.890
but you two are dating now.

05:23.890 --> 05:25.380
I knew it.

05:37.270 --> 05:38.940
How'd it go?

05:39.600 --> 05:42.740
They said it was probably 
just a common cold.

05:42.740 --> 05:47.720
I don't have any other symptoms, 
so the fever should go down in a few days.

05:48.900 --> 05:51.010
That's good to hear.

05:51.010 --> 05:53.460
I messaged Masaki-san for you.

05:54.000 --> 05:56.760
Come over to our house and get some rest.

05:58.250 --> 05:59.630
So, Umi...

05:59.630 --> 06:02.940
Aren't you glad Maki-kun's 
going to be all right?

06:02.940 --> 06:05.550
Why are you asking me?

06:05.820 --> 06:08.260
Oh, did you forget already?

06:09.850 --> 06:11.610
You were all like, "Maki's in trouble!"

06:11.610 --> 06:15.310
just this morning, waking me up 
looking like the world was going to end.

06:15.310 --> 06:18.920
You were so restless in 
the clinic waiting room, too.

06:18.920 --> 06:21.800
Hey, can you blame me?

06:22.440 --> 06:27.660
He was fine until last night, 
but now he looks so unwell.

06:27.660 --> 06:29.680
Even his voice sounded lifeless.

06:30.990 --> 06:34.810
We just started dating.

06:34.810 --> 06:38.840
I didn't want to suddenly 
not be able to see him.

06:40.030 --> 06:41.170
Sorry.

06:41.630 --> 06:43.210
You dummy.

06:43.210 --> 06:48.080
You're absolutely not allowed to fall sick
without my permission again, you hear?

06:48.660 --> 06:51.760
It hasn't even been 24 hours 
since we started going out,

06:51.760 --> 06:53.720
and I've made her sad already.

06:54.390 --> 06:56.630
What is wrong with me?

06:57.400 --> 06:59.240
Hup.

07:00.230 --> 07:01.360
Hey...

07:01.360 --> 07:02.470
What?

07:02.470 --> 07:06.020
Am I staying here until I recover?

07:06.020 --> 07:09.130
We got permission 
from your mom, okay?

07:09.130 --> 07:11.840
It was our idea, though, obviously.

07:11.840 --> 07:12.830
I see.

07:13.240 --> 07:18.350
Are you overthinking things again?

07:19.480 --> 07:21.170
You can tell, huh?

07:21.170 --> 07:25.300
I mean, duh. I'm your girlfriend.

07:26.990 --> 07:28.640
Now, c'mere.

07:29.810 --> 07:31.850
Umi's too good.

07:32.570 --> 07:37.690
I may be her boyfriend now, but I still 
don't feel like I'm good enough for her.

07:38.400 --> 07:44.030
I'm still this loser who falls sick all 
too easily and makes trouble for her.

07:44.830 --> 07:49.620
I'm getting away with it now, 
but she might grow tired of this someday.

07:50.670 --> 07:53.080
I was fine being on
 my own all these years,

07:53.440 --> 07:55.590
but if I lose Umi now...

07:57.610 --> 08:02.170
It's okay. I love you however you are.

08:03.810 --> 08:07.050
Sorry for getting all negative.

08:08.270 --> 08:13.010
Yeah, I'm not surprised. 
What am I gonna with you?

08:13.420 --> 08:17.980
Just let us handle things and 
focus on getting better, okay?

08:17.980 --> 08:19.600
Yeah, thanks.

08:30.610 --> 08:34.620
S-Sorry, I started wondering 
if you'd be able to sleep.

08:34.620 --> 08:40.040
Oh, I'll be fine. Just relax.

08:40.040 --> 08:41.100
Okay.

08:46.660 --> 08:48.720
Uh...

08:48.720 --> 08:49.550
So...

08:49.550 --> 08:53.930
Hey, I'm worried about you, okay?

08:54.430 --> 08:56.540
I don't wanna leave you alone!

08:56.540 --> 09:00.770
I don't wanna just go off and chill 
while you're having a hard time!

09:01.080 --> 09:03.330
You might catch my cold, you know.

09:03.330 --> 09:07.750
I know, but it doesn't feel right 
not being by your side.

09:11.320 --> 09:14.830
I guess I'll have to ask you 
to nurse me back to health, then.

09:16.010 --> 09:18.540
Yeah, that's the way!

09:21.040 --> 09:22.690
You're still burning up.

09:22.690 --> 09:26.590
Yeah, hold my hand and cool me down.

09:26.960 --> 09:29.550
Somebody's a real baby, huh?

09:30.200 --> 09:32.880
I just thought I could be myself with you.

09:33.740 --> 09:36.730
Yeah, go ahead and be a big baby.

09:37.230 --> 09:42.560
I'll spoil you to bits while you're here.

09:43.200 --> 09:45.560
Okay, I'm gonna sleep.

09:45.560 --> 09:48.650
Yeah, rest up.

09:51.950 --> 09:54.780
Okay, your fever's gone down quite a bit.

09:55.680 --> 09:56.990
Here, Maki.

09:57.790 --> 09:58.600
Uh...

09:58.600 --> 10:01.370
Oh, sorry. I forgot to blow on it for you.

10:04.190 --> 10:05.460
Here you are.

10:05.710 --> 10:07.730
That's not what I was trying to say.

10:07.730 --> 10:08.450
Here!

10:14.540 --> 10:15.640
That's good.

10:15.640 --> 10:18.450
Yeah? Glad to hear it.

10:19.240 --> 10:22.140
Hey, are we really okay with this?

10:22.140 --> 10:23.600
You know...

10:23.600 --> 10:28.480
It's fine. They're going 
to sleep on different futons.

10:28.480 --> 10:34.120
Sure, but they're young. 
What if they're young and stupid?

10:34.120 --> 10:37.340
Maki-kun's sick and has no energy.

10:37.340 --> 10:40.410
If anything, Umi will have 
to be the one who initiates.

10:42.110 --> 10:43.870
I'm turning off the light, okay?

10:43.870 --> 10:45.790
Yeah, good night.

10:46.610 --> 10:47.820
Good night.

10:57.760 --> 11:00.220
She's so cute when she's asleep, too.

11:00.990 --> 11:03.310
I love you, Umi.

11:04.150 --> 11:09.240
She cares about me and 
worries about me, of all people.

11:09.240 --> 11:11.020
She's my one and only...

11:11.020 --> 11:12.770
The girl I love.

11:14.260 --> 11:17.100
Actually, I don't want to wake her.

11:18.880 --> 11:20.920
Sure you don't wanna touch my face?

11:21.790 --> 11:23.610
Wait, you were awake for all that?

11:25.080 --> 11:26.290
Maki.

11:26.740 --> 11:27.910
Yes, ma'am?

11:27.910 --> 11:31.780
Tell me what you said one more time.

11:32.910 --> 11:37.160
Please? If you say it, I'll give you 
permission to touch my face.

11:39.010 --> 11:42.100
Will you also go to sleep then?

11:42.100 --> 11:43.940
I will, I will.

11:43.940 --> 11:48.020
And I'll take care of you 
all day tomorrow.

11:54.040 --> 11:55.740
You're still a bit hot.

11:56.060 --> 12:01.950
Yeah. So I'm sorry, but you'll 
need to spoil me a little more.

12:01.950 --> 12:04.300
No problem.

12:05.520 --> 12:07.910
I love you, Umi.

12:09.010 --> 12:11.630
I love you lots, too.

12:14.490 --> 12:15.900
Good night.

12:18.030 --> 12:20.210
My fever's gone down quite a bit.

12:22.300 --> 12:24.100
CAUGHT A COLD

12:22.300 --> 12:24.100
39 C

12:22.300 --> 12:24.100
ON MY WAY, SIT TIGHT

12:22.300 --> 12:24.100
TODAY

12:22.300 --> 12:24.100
MAKI, ARE YOU OKAY?
YOU BETTER BE IN BED, ALL RIGHT?

12:27.310 --> 12:31.020
I'M OKAY. MY FEVER'S GONE DOWN

12:27.590 --> 12:31.020
Umi made plans with Amami-san 
and Nitta-san for today,

12:31.020 --> 12:33.140
so she went out this morning.

12:33.560 --> 12:36.930
I should get going soon.

12:36.930 --> 12:41.100
Don't just sit around playing games 
because I'm not around.

12:41.100 --> 12:45.540
What are you, my mom? 
I'll stay in bed until you're back.

12:49.000 --> 12:50.160
Maki-kun.

12:50.620 --> 12:54.360
I'd like to clean the room. Do you mind?

12:54.360 --> 12:55.380
Oh, sure.

12:55.710 --> 12:56.630
Go ahead.

12:58.230 --> 13:00.570
Excuse me, then.

13:07.030 --> 13:09.720
This year's almost over, huh?

13:09.720 --> 13:11.060
Yeah.

13:11.060 --> 13:15.730
The older you get, the faster 
each year seems to fly by.

13:16.950 --> 13:19.780
I'm really grateful to you, Maki-kun.

13:19.780 --> 13:20.600
Huh?

13:20.600 --> 13:21.950
For my daughter's sake.

13:22.340 --> 13:27.520
It's been years and years since 
I've seen her so expressive.

13:28.020 --> 13:31.920
Believe it or not, she used to be quite 
the troublemaker when she was little.

13:31.920 --> 13:34.720
She'd drag her friends around until late,

13:34.720 --> 13:38.380
and when her father and I scolded her, 
she'd bawl her eyes out.

13:39.200 --> 13:42.460
Oh, it's barely visible now, 
but did you know...

13:42.460 --> 13:46.820
She has a pretty big scar 
around the hairline of her forehead.

13:46.820 --> 13:47.510
What?

13:47.810 --> 13:52.440
She ran into a table corner and 
started gushing blood all over.

13:52.740 --> 13:55.660
It scared the living 
daylights out of me.

13:55.660 --> 13:58.280
I had no idea she had such a brat era.

13:58.920 --> 14:02.990
Well, she's in her cutest era now 
whenever she talks about you.

14:03.520 --> 14:07.410
She looks so full of life 
whenever your name comes up.

14:07.820 --> 14:10.640
She turns red and acts angry 
when I make fun of her for it,

14:10.640 --> 14:13.400
but then she actually 
looks happy about it.

14:14.350 --> 14:19.170
That made me realize that 
Umi will always be my baby girl.

14:19.790 --> 14:25.260
Oh, I'm so sorry for talking your ear off 
when you should be resting.

14:25.260 --> 14:31.740
Don't be. It's a lot more fun listening 
to you than just lying around.

14:31.740 --> 14:36.620
So, Maki-kun, I know this 
is a very selfish request,

14:36.620 --> 14:40.510
but I hope you'll continue 
to be there for Umi.

14:41.120 --> 14:43.770
She's the kind of kid 
who can do anything with ease,

14:43.770 --> 14:48.330
but that also exposes her 
to needless problems to worry about.

14:48.330 --> 14:53.250
Of course. I'm already pretty sure I want 
to be there for her more than anybody.

14:53.690 --> 14:55.960
More than us too, you mean?

14:55.960 --> 15:00.810
Okay, maybe not as much as you. 
Sorry about that.

15:00.810 --> 15:03.080
I got a little carried away.

15:03.080 --> 15:06.760
Aw, you could've stood 
your ground there, you know?

15:06.760 --> 15:09.680
You take things a little 
too seriously sometimes.

15:10.020 --> 15:15.740
But maybe that's why neither we 
nor Umi can seem to leave you alone.

15:17.560 --> 15:19.650
Pardon us!

15:20.270 --> 15:24.080
I haven't come over 
to your place in so long!

15:24.080 --> 15:25.360
You know...

15:25.360 --> 15:29.520
Who brings a boyfriend home and makes him 
stay over the day after they start dating?

15:29.520 --> 15:31.830
Asanagi's got a ravenous side to her, huh?

15:31.830 --> 15:32.870
W-Wrong!

15:32.870 --> 15:37.070
He's in our guest room! And my mom and 
I are taking turns looking after him!

15:40.070 --> 15:44.960
Hello there, Maki-kun. We heard 
you were sick and came to visit you.

15:44.960 --> 15:48.970
Oh man, that's funny. 
You seriously look half-mummy, class rep.

15:48.970 --> 15:52.100
You might be full-mummy by tomorrow.

15:52.100 --> 15:55.140
I'm a lot better today 
than I was before, actually.

15:55.140 --> 15:56.940
It's still good to see you two.

15:56.940 --> 15:59.240
Yup, it's been a couple of days.

15:59.240 --> 16:00.290
Wassup?

16:00.290 --> 16:01.190
Sorry.

16:01.480 --> 16:05.410
They asked me why I was 
looking at my phone so often.

16:06.570 --> 16:11.030
I could tell she seemed off 
from the moment she showed up.

16:11.380 --> 16:16.410
Umi was just so cute, 
worrying about her beloved boyfriend!

16:16.410 --> 16:20.100
I know, right? 
She usually inhales her food,

16:20.100 --> 16:22.130
but her mind was 
somewhere else today.

16:22.130 --> 16:29.220
"My beloved boyfriend is suffering 
in bed! I can't just stuff my face!"

16:29.220 --> 16:31.390
Is that what you were thinking, Umi-chan?

16:31.850 --> 16:34.120
Talk about devoted.

16:34.120 --> 16:35.970
Why, you two...

16:35.970 --> 16:39.580
Oh, right! Since we have 
you two together here,

16:39.580 --> 16:42.560
why don't you tell us about 
what happened on Christmas Eve?

16:42.560 --> 16:44.590
Nice idea, Yuu-chin.

16:44.590 --> 16:49.900
Asanagi was too shy to tell us anything, 
but our honest class rep might.

16:49.900 --> 16:54.410
Maki! Ignore these two morons 
and rest up, okay?

16:54.410 --> 16:57.500
Aww, Umi, you meanie.

16:57.500 --> 16:59.500
Are you thirsty, Maki-kun?

16:59.500 --> 17:01.770
You need to stay hydrated.

17:01.770 --> 17:03.910
By the way, did you two 
sleep together last night?

17:03.910 --> 17:06.420
Rep, what'd you say 
when you asked her out?

17:06.420 --> 17:07.920
Also, didya do it already?

17:07.920 --> 17:09.680
Nina, you little...!

17:10.260 --> 17:11.470
Sorry!

17:11.470 --> 17:13.520
Get outta here!

17:12.420 --> 17:14.120
No way!

17:15.580 --> 17:18.020
While the first couple of days

17:18.020 --> 17:21.340
of my time recuperating 
in the Asanagi residence were hectic,

17:21.340 --> 17:25.400
the rest of it was thankfully 
uneventful for Umi and me.

17:26.980 --> 17:28.690
DECEMBER 31

17:27.370 --> 17:32.470
I didn't expect to spend 
a whole week here, though.

17:32.470 --> 17:36.460
Great. A normal temp, 
just like last night.

17:36.460 --> 17:39.510
You probably don't need 
to medicate anymore.

17:39.510 --> 17:41.410
I feel a lot better now.

17:41.710 --> 17:44.230
I think I can go home for New Year's.

17:45.270 --> 17:48.720
Oh, you're going to leave.

17:51.630 --> 17:52.880
Hey, Maki?

17:53.190 --> 17:56.520
So, can I ask you for something?

17:59.380 --> 18:00.680
You see...

18:03.990 --> 18:07.290
Well, uh...

18:08.380 --> 18:11.340
Morning, Umi.

18:28.090 --> 18:29.090
DECEMBER 31

18:29.090 --> 18:30.340
JANUARY 1

18:32.510 --> 18:36.000
Umi, Maki-kun, Ninacchi! Happy New Year!

18:36.000 --> 18:37.420
Let's make it a good one!

18:38.160 --> 18:39.750
Happy New Year, Yuu.

18:39.750 --> 18:41.730
Happy New Year, Amami-san.

18:42.710 --> 18:45.190
HNY, y'all.

18:45.190 --> 18:47.060
Happy New Year, everyone.

18:47.330 --> 18:50.990
When do you wanna meet up 
for our New Year's shrine visit?

18:50.990 --> 18:53.570
I'm already good to go.

18:54.370 --> 19:00.530
Me, too! I went all-out and asked 
my mom to put out a kimono for me!

19:00.530 --> 19:01.670
How about you, Umi?

19:03.560 --> 19:08.590
She'll wear one, obviously. 
She's in peak lovey-dovey mode right now.

19:08.590 --> 19:10.620
Of course! What was I thinking?

19:10.620 --> 19:14.760
Okay, let's meet up in an hour by 
the usual parking lot near the shrine.

19:14.760 --> 19:18.690
Curb your imaginations, will you?!

19:33.350 --> 19:34.900
What do you think, Maki-kun?

19:35.160 --> 19:36.580
Do I look good?

19:36.580 --> 19:38.950
Yeah, you look great.

19:40.100 --> 19:41.830
Come on now, class rep.

19:42.470 --> 19:45.940
You're a taken guy, though freshly minted.

19:45.940 --> 19:48.250
Learn how to compliment a girl better.

19:48.250 --> 19:50.660
You look good too, Nitta-san.

19:50.660 --> 19:56.660
Cheers. I guess we're just 
extras in your eyes.

19:56.660 --> 19:57.440
Right?

19:58.670 --> 20:00.200
Asanagi-san?

20:07.280 --> 20:10.380
That looks amazing on you. Like...

20:11.040 --> 20:12.850
You look beautiful, Umi.

20:13.190 --> 20:16.960
You told me that before I left home.

20:29.000 --> 20:30.790
FORTUNE
GREAT LUCK

20:29.640 --> 20:30.790
Whoa.

20:30.790 --> 20:33.750
Wow, Maki! You got great luck!

20:34.070 --> 20:37.430
What's it say? 
"Everything will go as you wish,"

20:37.430 --> 20:41.230
"but should you get complacent and 
not put in the effort to keep it going,"

20:41.230 --> 20:44.050
"misfortune will befall you, 
so stay diligent"?

20:44.050 --> 20:48.040
Basically, don't take 
these times for granted.

20:48.040 --> 20:48.970
What'd you get?

20:49.560 --> 20:53.520
Mid luck. My actual fortune's 
not very different from yours.

20:53.520 --> 20:58.550
I envy you two and your luck. 
All I got was minor luck.

20:58.550 --> 21:01.240
Eh, fortunes are just a game.

21:01.570 --> 21:03.200
Let's go tie them up over there.

21:03.200 --> 21:05.420
They're giving out amazake for free, too.

21:05.420 --> 21:09.800
Nice! Time to stuff ourselves 
to kick off the year!

21:10.200 --> 21:11.080
Hey, Maki.

21:12.120 --> 21:15.780
You had your eyes closed 
for quite a while when we prayed.

21:15.780 --> 21:17.380
What did you wish for?

21:17.380 --> 21:19.800
Oh, uh...

21:20.710 --> 21:26.870
"I hope all the people in my life 
spend this year happy and healthy."

21:26.870 --> 21:29.980
Oh, same as me, then.

21:30.420 --> 21:33.250
Nothing beats good health, huh?

21:33.250 --> 21:34.110
Yep, yep.

21:34.680 --> 21:38.940
I realized that while taking care of 
a certain someone a few days ago.

21:38.940 --> 21:40.580
I owe you big-time.

21:40.580 --> 21:41.950
You sure do.

21:42.300 --> 21:45.580
Don't make me worry too much, okay?

21:46.060 --> 21:48.220
Yeah, I'll keep that in mind.

21:51.230 --> 21:52.370
Dummy.

21:53.830 --> 21:56.640
I've got to take care of myself.

21:58.760 --> 22:01.370
And once I've done that,

22:01.860 --> 22:05.410
I'll do everything I can to be there 
for Umi as her boyfriend.

22:07.140 --> 22:10.810
